# Frequency conversion between hertz and megahertz

Verifies direct conversion between hertz and megahertz in both directions. Hertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion and four-place rounding, while megahertz converts exactly to hertz.

>>> source
const forward_whole: int = 1hz
print(forward_whole->to(mhz))
const forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5hz
print(forward_fractional->to(mhz))
const backward_whole: int = 1mhz
print(backward_whole->to(hz))
const backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5mhz
print(backward_fractional->to(hz))

<<< stdout
0.0000mhz
0.0000mhz
1000000hz
1500000.0hz

<<< stderr
